  "releaseNotes": "Security and protocol fixes: AuthenticatedRequestHandler runs after signature validation; canned ACL writes reach WriteAcl with a null policy; signature checks fail closed if GetSecretKey is cleared; CopyObject and UploadPartCopy route to new Object.Copy and Object.UploadPartCopy callbacks instead of Object.Write; parse failures return S3 XML errors; malformed Range headers are ignored and suffix ranges route to ReadRange; S3 XML namespace on responses; 304 Not Modified support; request-only default headers removed. See CHANGELOG.md for behavior changes and opt-out settings.",
